# CGP v2 — Frontend environment variables
# Copy to .env.local (never commit .env files) and fill in real values.

# VAPID public key for Web Push notifications (F7).
# The Go backend does NOT expose the VAPID public key via any API route
# (it is configured server-side via the VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY env var, see
# api/internal/config/config.go), so the SPA reads the matching PUBLIC key
# here to call pushManager.subscribe({ applicationServerKey }).
# Generate a pair with:  npx web-push generate-vapid-keys
# The private key goes to the API container (VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY).
VITE_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=
# NOTE: leave this empty in dev to see the "Chưa cấu hình thông báo." state.
